{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":310.1199951171875,"text":"Okay, so I'm going to just do a review and just like point out things that don't look good. Deashi burai looks good, but for deashi burai, notice that the skateboard is like not attached to the person's leg. I see what you're trying to illustrate, but I'd rather just have the person like stepping on it and kind of slipping. Yuzu guruma is good, sase is good. Maybe redo the analogy for the sase, because it doesn't look like the person was actually tripped. Like the positioning of the two people doesn't make sense, and you can adjust the prompt wherever you need to for that. Uki goshi, good. Seio nage could be a little better. Maybe the kid shouldn't be so far away from the mom. I don't know if he would get hurled that far, but it's not terrible. Ochigari is good. Ogoshi, the little kid getting dumped out of the wheelbarrow, his legs and body positioning don't make sense. It's almost like his upper body is spun 180 degrees. Osotogari, I simply don't like the analogy. A broom sweeping the leg out from under a chair doesn't make sense. There's no real life situation where a broom would be sweeping under a chair that would be tipped back. Maybe just think of something else. Kosoto is good, ochigari is good, even though they're kind of the same thing, that's actually fine. Koshi guruma is good. Surikomi goshi, the image is almost good, but it just doesn't make sense. The bucket is being pulled up, but the water is spilling in the opposite direction, not over. If that's hard, try to render it a few more times. If it's difficult, just use another analogy. Uchimata is pretty good, but the turnstile thing is going up into the guy's crotch, not in their leg. Haraigoshi is kind of weird, and again, a broom wouldn't be sweeping a person's leg in that situation. Something else could be lifting their body up, but yeah, the broom just doesn't make sense. It's also weirdly touching the guy's body. For tai otoshi, incredible, don't change a thing. Okuri ashi harai is pretty good. Kosoto is great, surigoshi is good, yoko otoshi is good. Haraigoshi guruma could be a little bit better. Maybe just try a few more of them. The kid's body positioning doesn't make sense. Kata guruma could be better. Going back to tai otoshi, the actual throw image doesn't look good. Redo the tai otoshi throw. Somenage is good, harai sumikomi ashi is good, but again, that broom doing the sweeping of the legs of the marionette, I think we could just use a better analogy for harai sumikomi ashi. Hanegoshi, use another analogy. Sumigeshi, the kid is being thrown forward as opposed to backwards with the airplane game, so do the analogy again. Tai otoshi doesn't look like the throw, so fix the throw with tai otoshi. And the positioning of the kids with the push could be better. Hanemakakomi is perfect. Sukuinage is pretty good, maybe try to think of another one for that. Ukigoshi is very good, but the bull is kind of like crashing down like a missile into the ground and it's not a realistic like bullfighting situation. Sotomakakomi is good, oguruma is very good, utsuri goshi is pretty good, maybe try another one and just present it and see, but I think that's not suffice. Osoto is good, ukiwaza, maybe do another one for the analogy, yokowaka are definitely do another one for the analogy, yokoguruma is great, yokogake, the throw image doesn't make sense, use another one, sumiotoshi is pretty good, uranage, use another one, utsuri goshi, use another analogy image, and for uranage, I meant do another analogy image. All in all, these are very good.","segments":[{"id":0,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"end":10.880000114440918,"text":" Okay, so I'm going to just do a review and just like point out things that don't look","tokens":[50364,3477,320,11,370,286,478,516,281,445,360,257,3131,293,445,411,935,484,721,300,500,380,574,50908],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3252176344394684,"compression_ratio":1.6331658363